halium-wrappers               https://github.com/droidian/halium-wrappers              bookworm
parse-android-dynparts        https://github.com/droidian/parse-android-dynparts       bookworm
initramfs-tools-halium        https://github.com/droidian/initramfs-tools-halium       droidian
wlroots                       https://github.com/droidian/wlroots                      feature/next/upgrade-0-17-4
phoc                          https://github.com/droidian/phoc                         feature/next/upgrade-0.40.0
bluebinder                    https://github.com/droidian/bluebinder                   bookworm
ofono                         https://github.com/droidian/ofono                        bookworm
ofono-binder-plugin           https://github.com/droidian/ofono-binder-plugin          droidian
ofono2mm                      https://github.com/droidian/ofono2mm                     droidian
